  "//": "own = hooks our own code creates, not Hermes (attribute names or full keys as the doctor prints them). Anything starting mg-, mf-, bb- or monograph is ours without an entry. overrides = hooks Hermes builds at runtime, mapped to the source string that proves they still exist. Sorted, one entry per line: add with  node scripts/doctor.mjs --own '<hook>'.",
